47
00:02:56,880 --> 00:03:01,157
Bahasa Jepun, atau Nippon Go, dijadikan lingua franca.

48
00:03:01,157 --> 00:03:05,593
Setiap pagi, murid berhimpun menghadap ke arah Jepun dan

49
00:03:05,593 --> 00:03:07,653
